<section class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-4">
    <h1 class="mb-10 text-4xl font-bold text-white/80">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">Getting Started</h2>
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">Is Sharp Tabs free to use?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">
                Yes! Every feature in Sharp Tabs is free, and you don't need an account. Themes, custom CSS, backgrounds,
                workspaces, session backups, tab suspending and every customization option are included for everyone.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">Why do AI features need an API key or subscription?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">
                AI features (Prompt to Organize, AI auto-organize, AI group naming and AI tab cleanup) have to call an AI
                model, and every call costs money. You can add your own free Gemini API key in the settings, or, if you
                prefer not to manage a key, get the optional Sharp Tabs AI subscription. Everything else never needs either.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">Features & Customization</h2>
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">How can I make the sidebar narrower?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400">
                This isn't possible at the moment due to a limitation in chrome it self. Please vote to allow narrower sidebars <a
                    href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40926440"
                >
                    in this request.</a
                >

                Vivaldi is another great option because it allows you to customize the sidebar width and even make the sidebar
                float over the page content.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">
                How can I use a beautiful theme from <a
                    href="https://tweakcn.com"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-blue-400 underline">tweakcn.com</a
                >?
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">
                Custom CSS is free! Just apply the instructions in
                <a
                    href="https://gist.github.com/maddada/d550020d5991c2a3f93395c33cf0b8ea"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-blue-400 underline"
                >
                    this readme file
                </a>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">What is Prompt to Organize?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">
                Type one quick instruction, like "Create a new group for all YouTube links", and AI finds the matching
                tabs for you. You review the tabs before anything changes. Open it from the header menu in Sharp Tabs.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">How can I use AI features for free?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">
                You can bring your own Gemini API key! Get a free key from
                <a
                    href="https://aistudio.google.com/apikey"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-blue-400 underline"
                >
                    Google AI Studio
                </a>
                and add it in the extension settings. All AI features (Prompt to Organize, auto-organize, group naming
                and tab cleanup) will then work without an account or subscription.
            </p>
        </div>
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">Account & Support</h2>
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">
                    Do I need an account to use Sharp Tabs?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">
                    No. Sharp Tabs works fully without signing in. You only sign in if you choose the optional AI
                    subscription instead of using your own Gemini API key.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-primary-light">
                    How can I get support or share feedback?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">
                    You can reach out on <a href="mailto:support@sharptabs.com" class="text-blue-400 underline"
                        >support@sharptabs.com</a
                    > or join <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/SharpTabs/" class="text-blue-400 underline"
                        >our subreddit</a
                    > to connect with the community and share your feedback.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </section>
</section>
